  "body": "I noticed that https://w3c-test.org/dom/interfaces.html still fails due to SVGElement when I was looking to implement AbstractRange.\r\n\r\nWe've since added HTMLOrSVGElement to the SVG spec so the \"`SVGElement includes HTMLOrSVGElement;`\" line can be removed (and the web platform tests interface idl test updated)\r\nhttps://svgwg.org/svg2-draft/types.html#InterfaceSVGElement\r\n\r\nI'd also personally prefer it if `HTMLElement includes HTMLOrSVGElement` statement is moved up to HTMLElement where its other include statements are to make it clearer and more consistent that this mixin is included. \r\n\r\nCC @annevk ",
